OL,3,ABurnham and Badenoch clash over UK
OL,4,Agovernment borrowing and approval for
OL,5,ANorth Sea drilling
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham is facing Prime Minister's
OL,8,FQuestions - watch live at the top of
OL,9,Fthe page
OL,11,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch
OL,12,Fbegins by asking Burnham if the
OL,13,Fgovernment will overturn Labour's
OL,14,Fmanifesto commitment not to grant new
OL,15,Foil and gas licences
OL,17,FThis morning, the government announced
OL,18,Fit was approving the Jackdaw gas field
OL,19,F- where a licence was granted in 2022,
OL,20,Fbefore being delayed in the courts
